{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07342","headline":"留题李明府霅溪水堂 · 刘长卿","name":"留题李明府霅溪水堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寥寥此堂上，幽意复谁论。\n落日无王事，青山在县门。\n云峰向高枕，渔钓入前轩。\n晚竹疎帘影，春苔双履痕。\n荷香随坐卧，湖色映晨昏。\n虚牖闲生白，鸣琴静对言。\n暮禽飞上下，春水带清浑。\n远岸谁家柳，孤烟何处村。\n谪居投瘴疠，离思过湘沅。\n从此扁舟去，谁堪江浦猿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07342.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07342","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}